<Layout
  title="VETCARE HOSPITAL — Clínica Veterinaria, Especialidades & Pet Shop | Demo Archity"
  description="Clínica veterinaria integral con agendamiento de citas médicas online, atención de emergencias 24/7 y Pet Shop con catálogo interactivo paginado."
>
  <!-- Barra superior permanente: Demo Mode Archity -->
  <div class="sticky top-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-sky-950/20 bg-neutral-950 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-neutral-300">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-sky-400"></span>
      <span class="font-medium">Demostración de Hospital Veterinario &amp; Pet Shop</span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-neutral-500">· Desarrollada por Archity</span>
    </div>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-neutral-800 px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 transition-colors"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
      </svg>
      Volver al Portafolio
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Header Propio de VetCare Hospital -->
  <header class="sticky top-8 z-40 border-b border-neutral-200 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md shadow-xs">
    <div class="mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Logotipo de la Clínica Veterinaria -->
      <a href="/demos/veterinaria" class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-600 text-white shadow-sm font-bold">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <span class="block font-display text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900">VETCARE HOSPITAL</span>
          <span class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-700 font-semibold">Medicina Veterinaria &amp; Pet Care · Urgencias 24h</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Navegación de la Veterinaria -->
      <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-600">
        <a href="#servicios-medicos" class="hover:text-sky-700 transition-colors">Servicios Clínicos</a>
        <a href="#pet-shop" class="hover:text-sky-700 transition-colors">Pet Shop Paginado</a>
        <a href="#agendar-cita" class="hover:text-sky-700 transition-colors">Agendar Consulta</a>
        <a href="#contacto-vet" class="hover:text-sky-700 transition-colors">Sedes &amp; Contacto</a>
      </nav>

      <!-- Teléfono de Urgencias & Carrito -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="tel:+51940771896"
          class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-700 hover:text-sky-700"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-sky-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
          </svg>
          <span>(01) 480-1200</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="#carrito-petshop"
          class="relative flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-sky-600 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-white hover:bg-sky-700 transition-colors shadow-xs"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z" />
          </svg>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">Carrito Pet</span>
          <span id="header-vet-count" class="inline-flex h-4.5 min-w-4.5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-sky-700">0</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero Veterinaria -->
    <section class="border-b border-neutral-200/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-50/70 via-white to-white py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
          <div class="lg:col-span-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-800">Hospital Veterinario &amp; Urgencias Médicas 24 Horas</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
              Salud, Cuidado y Amor para <span class="text-sky-600">tu Mascota</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:text-lg">
              Atención médica preventiva, quirófano de alta complejidad, diagnóstico por imágenes, vacunación oficial y tienda Pet Shop con entrega express a domicilio.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <a
                href="#agendar-cita"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-sky-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-xs transition-all hover:bg-sky-700 active:scale-95"
              >
                Agendar Cita Médica
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
              </a>

              <a
                href="#pet-shop"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-800 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50"
              >
                Explorar Pet Shop Paginado
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Stats veterinaria con iconos SVG limpios (sin emojis) -->
            <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-neutral-200/80 pt-6 text-left">
              <div>
                <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">+14,000</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Mascotas Atendidas</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-sky-600">24 / 7</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Urgencias y Quirófano</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                  <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">4.9</span>
                  <div class="flex text-amber-500">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Calificación de Tutores</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero Image Hospital -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl">
              <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-sky-100">
                <img
                  src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583337130417-3346a1be7dee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
                  alt="Doctor Veterinario atendiendo paciente"
                  class="h-56 w-full object-cover"
                />
                <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 rounded-full bg-sky-600 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-white shadow-sm">
                  Hospital Central
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5">
                <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-neutral-900">Guardia Médica Activa</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-600">
                  Médicos veterinarios especialistas de guardia permanente para cirugías de urgencia, intoxicaciones y politraumatismos.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-sky-50 p-3.5 text-xs text-sky-950 font-semibold">
                  <span>Central de Emergencias 24h:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-sky-700">(01) 480-1200</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Servicios Médicos Veterinarios -->
    <section id="servicios-medicos" class="border-b border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-700">Especialidades Médicas</span>
          <h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 sm:text-3xl">
            Cuidado Integral en Cada Etapa de su Vida
          </h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-xs text-neutral-600">
            Equipamiento de última generación y profesionales colegiados al servicio de la salud y bienestar de caninos y felinos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900">Vacunación &amp; Desparasitación</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">Esquemas completos para cachorros y adultos con carnet oficial del CMVP.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900">Cirugía &amp; Esterilización</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">Quirófano estéril con monitoreo multiparamétrico y anestesia inhalatoria.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900">Diagnóstico por Imágenes</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">Rayos X digitalizados de alta definición y ecografía doppler abdominal.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
